{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_8_level_main_08-06_end","groupId":"main_8","stageId":"main_08-06","title":"战场，蔓延不止","storyCode":"R8-6","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_08-06_end.txt","sourceHash":"36acf45399ef8aa51c53eac2f3ecf9093804b8b2575f6dfc13b83450c07ce44c","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snow_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢您的支援，先生......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——塔露拉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想离开雪原？你会被乌萨斯的铁甲碾碎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"爸？为什么是现在？我们不是打赢了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"盾卫已经去收集资源。你收队。命令全部人转移。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"......是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你和你的计划会让所有人都送命。"},{"type":"narration","text":"塔露拉意识到，面前的巨人是第一次对自己发表他的意见。即使这意见不可撼动，伤人入骨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"西北冻原也不能让我们活下去。我们的队伍越壮大，就越需要食物与能源补给，厌恶我们的聚落远比支持我们的村庄更多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"一年一季的苔麦......哪怕我们也参与耕种，那能收成多少？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"我们的田地会不会被纠察队毁掉？游击队能够轻松地战胜他们，但其他的感染者做不到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在加速他们的死亡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"我们只有离开冻原。不是去萨米，也不是去荒地......我们向东方去，向南方去，向温暖的地方去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你要怎么样生存下去？ 你要怎样让我们这么多人生存下去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"游击队是在救人。游击队绝不会牺牲游击队之外的人。只有战士才牺牲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"然而，在各个城市和城市周边生活的感染者，远比在冻原上的更多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"您常驻守北方，对北方感染者的遭遇深恶痛绝......所以您也不太有机会了解到，南方的感染者是怎样生活的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们过得很好？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"他们过得很糟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想吸纳他们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"我要团结他们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"帝国看向感染者时，你首当其冲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"不是团结在我身边。不。是团结在同一个理念周围。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"理念？感染者在冻原上被当作锯末，在矿场里被当作废渣，在聚落被当作惩示，在城市被当作什么燃料。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"冻原上的感染者既不无知也不愚蠢。我们不抱幻想。所有的理念在被实践前都是幻想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"冻原上还有矿场，有巡逻队，有愚蠢懈怠的守军。我们有地方获得资源。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"冰原上的资源迟早会被耗尽，因为我们没有开发资源的手段。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"我们没有可持久运作的移动城市，我们没有称职专业的天灾信使......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走向城市，我们一无所有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"我们会获得新的朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谁是你的朋友？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可以承认你的计划有过人之处。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然而，你所图谋的，即使有可取之处也不出奇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有多少战略家在冻原上潦倒而死？你所说的这些，我看不出你为何能做到，靠什么去实现。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么先皇能让大地颤抖？因为他执着于此，且从不谈论远大愿景。他只迈步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而你不能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"先生！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"你说我会被乌萨斯的铁甲碾碎，我承认，他们迟早会看向我们这里。我们总有一天会被抓到。我们都逃不过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"“让他们来”？您会这样想吗，先生？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"冻原会让您更好地准备一场决战吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在寻找一个新的战场？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"我在找寻一个胜机。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"对于更多感染者来说那是希望。但对于你我这种战士，那是一个契机。摆脱我们固有战略的唯一契机。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"在冻原上的辗转到头来也只是慢性死亡......就像我们身为感染者剩下的那点生命一样。我要不断重复这一点，因为你我都清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我女儿也许会相信你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我不相信一个从没因事实而失望，一直只是在陈托某种假大空的学说的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"塔露拉？你去哪里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"没事的。只是去检查矿场有没有生还者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"游击队已经带队出发，聚落也开始转移了。乌萨斯的军队也没有继续追踪我们的迹象......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"爸？你怎么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是普通的咳嗽。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"窸窣声"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"这里有人吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"......我知道你们在这。你们不是乌萨斯军人，你们连树枝都没踩断。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"我没有恶意。如果你们不是感染者，我也就此离开，除非你们需要帮助......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不，不准再靠近！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"别动！否则我就放箭了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"怯生生的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"她，她是感染者！萨沙，我的法术能把感染者赶走的......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨沙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不可以用法术！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"怯生生的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"萨沙......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨沙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你，你快点走开！我们只是从矿场里拿了些东西......我们不想杀人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨沙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我会放箭的！你会死！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"怯生生的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"萨沙......可是，可你说......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"你们有几天没吃饭了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨沙","speakerId":"avg_npc_085","isRemote":false,"text":"不关你事！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"在军驻矿场附近，你们也不敢生火。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"......你们抖得就像筛谷时的小麦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"怯生生的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_084","isRemote":false,"text":"呜......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨沙","speakerId":"avg_npc_085","isRemote":false,"text":"嘁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"不要怕。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"塔露拉用手抓住了一根树枝。\n她轻轻将树枝递向两个孩子，树枝由内而外飘出火星。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"怯生生的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_084","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨沙","speakerId":"avg_npc_085","isRemote":false,"text":"你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"暖和些了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"对，我的确是感染者。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snowconutry_2"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"原来是这样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"你就是这样找到萨沙和伊诺......他们一直不愿意和别人说之前的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我们没发现他们，他们肯定活不下去的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"也许在爱国者否定我之后，只有这件事算是好事了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"那今天这个是怎么回事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"......训练里我的法术不小心波及了霜星挂在旁边的斗篷。她要和我拼命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"你就答应她一定帮她缝好了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"事实上，阿丽娜......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"算了吧。给我吧，你对针线怕是一窍不通。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"你不想加入我们的队伍吗？也许加上你的伶牙俐齿，我说服爱国者的可能性更大些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"我说过了，塔露拉......我说过的。我的法术对游击队没用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"我可以沾上血，但我不想主动去伤害人。你以后可不单是会面对感染者纠察队。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"那我当时拉着你一起走......也许太难为你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，你故意这么说的，是不是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"没有，我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"你可别记岔了，是我要跟着你走的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"走到现在，只有一个原因，是因为......塔露拉，我觉得你很可能会忘记。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"忘记什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"忘记自己到底要做什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"我一直在为了感染者的未来而努力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"你最开始不是这么说的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"塔露拉，我们都知道人是会变的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"要是我们把自己坚持的东西都一点一点抛干净，或者换成新的东西的话，那是不是到某个时候，我们就其实没再坚持什么了呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"在不断的战斗和这些事情的变化里，我肯定要改变方针的。僵化的思维会让我们变得脆弱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"可你顽固的部分在哪呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"你是想证明，感染者和普通人一样，还是想证明，普通人和感染者一样呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"有什么区别？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"如果只有感染者，谁是普通人？我们是要让所有人都染上矿石病，还是让我们和普通人彻底隔绝呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"而如果只有普通人，没有感染者......感染了矿石病的是普通人，没有感染的也是普通人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"神民是普通人，先民是普通人，同乡那样的农民是普通人，城里居住的人，也该是普通人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"塔露拉，你想回到家人身边吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"我的家人就是你们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"哎。不是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"如果去掉我们身上的矿石病......我们就能回家了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"我和你一样，也认为不能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"冻原和我们的生活彻底改变了我们。感染者已经无法重回他们过去的生活了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snowconutryinside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"塔露拉，你现在还会因为自己是感染者而感到骄傲吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么这么问？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"因为不用法杖就能施术？因为我们的生命是这样短暂？因为我们即使遭遇这么多困难，依然也会坚持活下去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"塔露拉，你会选哪个理由？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"我没必要选，阿丽娜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"作为一个感染者，我就是骄傲的。因为这片大地还没杀得了我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"顺带一提，我们要追求公平也不需要什么原因。因为我们本来就该追求公平。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"如果这片大地不肯给，那我们就从它那拿回来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"那你是真的很勇敢了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"你没在笑我吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"没有，怎么会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，那......我觉得，是所有肯和这个强加在我们身上的命运斗争下去的人，都很勇敢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"那你一定觉得——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"唔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"觉得什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"我们的命运很烂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"那当然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"我不这么觉得，塔露拉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"......你又在说反话了，阿丽娜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"不......我是说，我能坐在这里，能和你聊天，知道聚落外面有我们的战士正在守候，命运待我已经很好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"可别这么说。命运是善妒的。你那么说，它指不定就把你说的这些都拿走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"可我是不相信命运的，塔露拉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"因为你能改变它？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"因为我看不见它。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"塔露拉，看得见摸得着的事情是可靠的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"我能看见自己手中的这件斗篷。我能看见烛光，能看见自己手中的针线。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"我能看见感染者孩子们的笑脸，我能看见烤得喷香的蔬菜上飘散出去的白色热气。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"我能看得见雪花，看得见夜空中两个月亮轻快的舞步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"而有的人连这些也看不见。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"塔露拉，如果有一天我们都离开了你，你还能战斗下去吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"这是什么话？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"总会发生的。到那时候，你还会觉得所谓的命运值得你去抗争吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"你会不会想，这太烂了，我已经什么都做不了了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"如果爱国者教会了我什么，那只有一点我觉得我已经学会了，而且早就学会了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"我不会低头。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"它嘲讽我，那我肯定会把它烧成灰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"好傻哦，塔露拉。除非你是个老头子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"喂！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"老头子说这种话才不会显得傻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"因为到了很老很老的时候如果还坚持这样想，那就说明他遭遇太多太多了，大地在他身上留下的糟糕痕迹已经不允许他安然度过自己的生活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"......那样的他是活在过去的沙漠中的。如果是我，我甚至没勇气迈出第一步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"要是我那么老又那么傲气，那我走的每一步就都是拿过去的所有事情来戳自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"我甚至想象不出，在那个记忆和过去的沙漠里，人要怎么样才能保证自己还在往前走？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"又要是怎么样强韧的精神，才能让他们迈出新的一步，不同于过往的更新的一步？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"总觉得你是在暗指谁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"我说了，我知道不少他的事，但我确实不认识爱国者老先生。我一句话也没和他说过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"你如果说是他的话，哎，那就是他吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"假如爱国者老先生......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"代入得还挺快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"和他们这些年老的战士不一样，年轻人却是会遗忘，会放弃，会宽恕自己的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，你觉得我只是在为了看得见的一切而战？或者说，这难道不对？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"和你在我们离开村子那时候对我说的句子相比，太浅了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"这么几年过来，你已经成了一个优秀的领袖。但这对你也不全是好事，你也不能让自己停在这里吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"“如果公义需要更多暴力才能伸张，那还能叫公义吗？”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"这句话已经困扰我许多年了，这么多年来我一直在想这件事。我可能没想通，但我可是一直在想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"那好，把刚才我们说的命运啊抗争啊这些个词儿全丢掉。阿丽娜老师，今天你想教我们些什么呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿。你是不是对霜星也那么油腔滑调的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"可别瞎说。霜星会把你我的嘴巴都冻上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"如果是你的话，塔露拉，你不会只是为了战胜看得见的敌人去战斗的吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"纠察队，矿场的监工，追踪着我们的征召兵，乌萨斯医学大臣......战胜那些，我们就胜利了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"因为这些东西很坏，所以我们要战胜它？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"阿丽娜老师是希望我和看不见的东西战斗。我要怎么战胜它们呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"和你能许诺的东西，温暖、食物、床被，与这些总有一天能摸得着的东西不一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"这场仗我们大概不会有结果，我们可能没办法赢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"我已经不太想许诺了。太远的事情无异于欺骗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"永远不会赢，那还要打吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"我不是问过吗？到那时候，你还觉得这个命运是值得你去抗争的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"这些都过去以后，你甚至连敌人都看不见了。你和那些看不见未来的人有同样的敌人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"......那时，真正的战斗才刚刚开始呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"你是在说那些精神，那些敌意，还有那些刻在乌萨斯人与我们骨子里的东西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"——皇帝？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"皇帝也只是它的一种样子吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"只要人们还不肯放下刀，那这场战争就不会结束。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"我不同意。人们拿起刀去对抗那些倾轧他们的东西是正义的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"没错。其实我认为这场战争，就是不会结束的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"莱塔尼亚和维多利亚的书，托爱国者先生的福，我也看了不少。我很喜欢有些人说的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"“我们的战争是一场针对自我的战争。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，塔露拉，因为你们不会放下手中的刀剑——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"......所以你也不会放下手中的针线。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"本节课到此结束！已经没什么好教你的了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"孩子们现在就该读书。有的知识他们明天就该知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"塔露拉......科西切要你是圣人，可人都会犯错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"摔倒以后要爬起来。但如果他不允许你摔倒......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"你就只能小心翼翼一点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"面对爱国者也是一样的，我其实不把他和你当成两种人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"你们都已经太相信自己的想法了，我却不能让那些活泼的小生命现在就说，你是对的他是错的这类的话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"不，阿丽娜。我不能去做我自己都不相信的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，这也是科西切使唤的伎俩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"你这不就是在说我没可能消灭他？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"那是一种思想。我们可能是没办法消灭一种思想......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"但我还是有点自信。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"什么自信？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我们那时候都还在你身边的话，我们一定能把你拉回来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"不管科西切的法术是什么样的东西，我们也一定有办法破得掉。我们总能做到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"这场战争，我们从文字和语言开始，从下一刻开始，从一个表情开始。从现在开始。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"他们会知道哪种蘑菇可以吃，该怎么养家畜，如果感冒的话要怎么才能早点好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"我们会试着不输掉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"如果是你也一定有机会说服爱国者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"这句我就勉强当是鼓励了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"喏，缝好了。给她吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"看得出她很爱惜这件斗篷。像是军队出产的。而且，里三层外三层，看着很大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"可能是军队的斗篷。也许是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"......爱国者先生能继续战斗下去的那些原因，我们说不定找到了其中一个。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢你，阿丽娜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"......等等！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么？我要准备明天的课了。这可是绘画课，他们都等着呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"下次再帮你弄两把笔刷回来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"我是说，我想说......我是想问，你真的......不想和霜星他们认识吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"战士们都知道我们有好几个感染者老师，只不过你把自己藏得严严实实的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"不是现在，塔露拉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"等你说的那个感染者共同的理想实现的时候，我和他们自然会认识的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"再说，我们可都是战士，只是战场不同。我们迟早会相互认识的，是不是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"没错，阿丽娜。感染者战士阿丽娜。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","aliases":["霜星"]}]}
